# Search speedup

1. `src/matcher.rs:5-9`
   ```rs
       for item in items {
           if item.contains(query) {
               out.push(item.clone());
           }
       }
   ```
   replace the loop with an iterator chain

2. `scripts/score.py:2:13-2:38`
   ```py
       total = sum(v * v for v in values)
   ```
   use math.fsum here

3. `web/App.vue:1-3`
   ```vue
   <template>
     <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
   </template>
   ```
   show the match count
   next to the title
